                // vertex shown as v0,v1,v2
                // interp index is i1 to progress in range [v0,v1[
                // interp index is i2 to progress in range [v0,v2[
                // face index as  (i1,i2)  for /\  : (i1,i2),(i1+1,i2),(i1,i2+1)
                //            and (i1,i2)' for \/  : (i1+1,i2),(i1+1,i2+1),(i1,i2+1)
                //
